(text "Mini v1.0: exact 15-hole footprint; component side up, pins down; NOT mirrored." (at 15 15.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 995a6bf1-c4eb-541e-87a4-96983930d8f3)) (text "EN goes directly to Teensy; 10k to this Mini's power ground holds EN low at reset." (at 15 18.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 353f42f6-70f2-57fc-afb3-5220ad2cbdfd)) (text "JP control-ground bridge defaults OPEN; module references its directly routed power-return pad." (at 15 22.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 493cee70-d8dc-5b7e-86e5-34a5d45b56f5)) (text "Breakout socket: 1 CLK, 2 MISO, 3 MOSI, 4 CSn, 5 3.3V, 6 GND. Pin 1 is marked." (at 15 25.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 6deb699b-07eb-5e88-bed4-dde52907f4d5)) (text "Mini 3.3V output, nRESET, nSLEEP and nFAULT contacts intentionally unconnected." (at 15 29.0 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 9fc93772-4b46-5fa0-b256-8639be722e7a)) )
